The mapping is injective on distinct virtual identities and shared by all occurrences of each identity. With indexed recipes and a visited set, restoration is linear in the reachable fields and slots, even with cycles. If allocation may trigger collection, blank objects must be safely traceable and the mapping must remain a set of registered roots; addresses in the example are illustrative. Restoring a frame also must not replay effects already executed before the guard.
